WEBVTT

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:32.749
has become accessible to everyone.

00:00:32.773 --> 00:00:37.788
But I wondered, what if there
could be no boundary at all?

00:00:37.812 --> 00:00:41.532
I started to imagine
what this would look like.

00:00:41.556 --> 00:00:43.983
First, I created this tool

00:00:44.007 --> 00:00:46.492
which penetrates into the digital space,

00:00:46.516 --> 00:00:48.583
so when you press it hard on the screen,

00:00:48.607 --> 00:00:51.916
it transfers its physical
body into pixels.

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.028
Designers can materialize their ideas

00:00:54.052 --> 00:00:55.724
directly in 3D,

00:00:55.748 --> 00:00:58.276
and surgeons can practice
on virtual organs

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:00.500
underneath the screen.